<!--pages/index/index.wxml  首页：搜索框 + 分类横向 Tab + 网站卡片列表（黑白灰 + 红）-->
<view class="container">

  <!-- 顶部 -->
  <view class="header">
    <view class="issue-row">
      <text class="issue-dot"></text>
      <text class="issue-no">SITE INDEX / 只读收录 · 无需登录</text>
      <view class="issue-entry" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onFavEntryTap">
        <view class="bm-icon {{favCount > 0 ? 'bm-icon-on' : ''}}"></view>
        <text class="issue-entry-text">收藏 {{favCount > 0 ? favCount : ''}}</text>
        <text class="issue-arrow">→</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="title-block">
      <text class="masthead">网站收录</text>
      <text class="masthead masthead-outline">导航</text>
      <view class="masthead-dot"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-row">
      <text class="rule-label">SITE INDEX</text>
      <view class="rule-line"></view>
      <text class="rule-count">{{tabCount}} CATEGORIES</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 搜索框 -->
    <view class="search-bar {{searchFocus ? 'search-bar-focus' : ''}}">
      <view class="search-icon"></view>
      <input
        class="search-input"
        type="text"
        value="{{keyword}}"
        placeholder="搜索网站名称或简介关键词"
        placeholder-class="search-placeholder"
        confirm-type="search"
        cursor-spacing="20"
        cursor-color="#e8231a"
        bindinput="onSearchInput"
        bindconfirm="onSearchConfirm"
        bindfocus="onSearchFocus"
        bindblur="onSearchBlur"
      />
      <view wx:if="{{keyword}}" class="search-clear" hover-class="btn-hover" catchtap="onClearKeyword">
        <view class="clear-x"></view>
        <view class="clear-y"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 分类横向 Tab -->
  <scroll-view class="tabs" scroll-x="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false" enable-flex="true">
    <view class="tabs-inner">
      <view
        class="tab {{activeIndex === 0 ? 'tab-active' : ''}}"
        data-index="0"
        hover-class="tab-hover"
        bindtap="onTabTap"
      >
        <text class="tab-index">00</text>
        <text class="tab-text">全部</text>
      </view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{tabs}}"
        wx:key="name"
        class="tab {{activeIndex === index + 1 ? 'tab-active' : ''}}"
        data-index="{{index + 1}}"
        hover-class="tab-hover"
        bindtap="onTabTap"
      >
        <text class="tab-index">{{item.no}}</text>
        <text class="tab-text">{{item.name}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <!-- 结果统计 -->
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !errorText && firstLoaded}}" class="result-bar">
    <view class="result-left">
      <text class="result-bar-mark"></text>
      <text class="result-text">{{totalText}}</text>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{keyword || activeCategory}}" class="result-reset" bindtap="onReset">清除条件</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 列表 -->
  <view class="list">

    <!-- 骨架屏 -->
    <block wx:if="{{loading}}">
      <view class="site-card" wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4]}}" wx:key="*this">
        <view class="sk-cover skeleton"></view>
        <view class="site-body">
          <view class="sk-line sk-line-title skeleton"></view>
          <view class="sk-line skeleton"></view>
          <view class="sk-line sk-line-short skeleton"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <!-- 错误 -->
    <view wx:elif="{{errorText}}" class="state-box">
      <view class="state-icon state-icon-warn">!</view>
      <text class="state-index">ERROR</text>
      <text class="state-title">数据没能加载出来</text>
      <text class="state-desc">{{errorText}}</text>
      <view class="state-actions">
        <view class="state-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 空结果 -->
    <view wx:elif="{{sites.length === 0}}" class="state-box">
      <view class="state-icon">?</view>
      <text class="state-index">NO RESULT</text>
      <text class="state-title">没有找到相关网站</text>
      <text class="state-desc">换个关键词，或者切回「全部」分类看看</text>
      <view class="state-actions">
        <view class="state-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onReset">查看全部</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 卡片 -->
    <block wx:else>
      <view
        class="site-card fade-in"
        wx:for="{{sites}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        hover-class="site-card-hover"
        hover-stay-time="80"
        bindtap="onCardTap"
      >
        <text class="site-no">{{item.no}}</text>

        <view class="cover-wrap" style="background:{{item.bgColor}}">
          <image
            wx:if="{{item.hasCover}}"
            class="cover"
            src="{{item.coverUrl}}"
            mode="aspectFill"
            lazy-load="true"
            data-id="{{item._id}}"
            binderror="onCoverError"
          />
          <view wx:else class="cover-fallback">
            <text class="cover-initial" style="color:{{item.inkColor}}">{{item.initial}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="site-body">
          <view class="site-title-row">
            <text class="site-name ellipsis">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="site-arrow">→</text>
          </view>

          <text class="site-desc ellipsis-2">{{item.description}}</text>

          <view class="site-meta">
            <view class="site-tag">
              <text class="tag-dot"></text>
              <text class="tag-text">{{item.category}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="site-url ellipsis">{{item.hostText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 加载更多 -->
      <view wx:if="{{loadingMore}}" class="load-more">
        <view class="spinner"></view>
        <text class="load-more-text">LOADING</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:elif="{{hasMore}}" class="load-more" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onLoadMore">
        <text class="load-more-text">加载更多</text>
        <text class="load-more-plus">+</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:elif="{{sites.length > 0}}" class="load-end">
        <view class="load-end-line"></view>
        <text class="load-end-text">END</text>
        <view class="load-end-line"></view>
      </view>
    </block>

  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
